# Optional: pre-fill the Spotify Client ID so the interactive prompt on
# first run is skipped. Not a secret — this app uses Authorization Code
# + PKCE, so no client secret is ever needed.
#
# Get one at https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard (create an app, add
# http://127.0.0.1:8888/callback as a Redirect URI).
#
# Usage: node --env-file=.env dist/index.js
SPOTICLEAN_CLIENT_ID=
